a include \"AC4: Differential tests compare factor output against gfactor for all R2.1-R2.4 scenarios\" and \"AC5: Existing R1.1-R1.4 tests continue to pass without modification\".\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5426/979c2815-5321-4814-a71c-9aca23f14cb5.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"979c2815-5321-4814-a71c-9aca23f14cb5","uuid":"c3990da0-5c86-41ab-8dbc-bc2995dd1893","timestamp":"2026-05-21T15:50:38.175Z","isSynthetic":true}
